'''Seekers''' are aggressive creatures found in the [[Mistlands]] and in [[Infested Mine]]s.

Seekers are large insectoid creatures with traits similar to beetles, ants, and bees. They have mandibles and three pairs of legs, the middle of which are larger and used to attack enemies. A pair of large leathery wings sprout from the back and can be used to fly short distances. Seekers and their [[Seeker Soldier|Soldier]] counterparts are implied to all be offspring of [[The Queen]], much the same as how real insect colonies function.

